  "mode": "factory template 1 (hold FACTORY and press the first TRACK CONTROL button), MIDI channel 9",
  "match": "Launch Control XL",
  "verified": false,
  "note": "built from the published chart, not tried on hardware. Factory templates 1-8 are MIDI channels 9-16; this is template 1. Knob rows a, b, c are top to bottom. The button LEDs take a colour code as the note-on velocity (Programmer's Reference Guide: 16 x green + red + 12), not a 0-127 level, so no binding gets feedback by default.",
  "sources": [
    "Novation Launch Control XL Programmer's Reference Guide (Focusrite, 2014): factory templates on channels 9-16, the LED protocol",
    "Ardour share/midi_maps/Novation_LaunchControl_XL.map (factory template 1, channel 9)"
  ],
